  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Algeria &#x2013; Incubation programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this project, the Orange Corners incubation programme in Algeria will be developed.This will strengthen the startup infrastructure in the country by offering an incubation programme in Algiers for 120 young social entrepreneurs over the course of three years, which will enable them to create new innovative businesses and social enterprises.At least 50% of these social entrepreneurs will be women, thereby supporting equal opportunities for women.</narrative>
  </description>
